#
# Expected Criterion benchmark groups of benches/clap_bench.rs.
# Operator diagnostic manifest: documents the expected Criterion groups for
# manual operator benchmarking (`cargo bench --bench clap_bench`). Not consumed
# by an automated gate (the plug performance gate is `nam_perf_guard certify`,
# which directly certifies the .clap artifact in tests-long.sh).
# `CLAP_Evidence` is the end-to-end inference anchor matrix.
CLAP_Infrastructure_*
CLAP_Inference_*
CLAP_WorstCase_*
CLAP_Evidence_*
